# Round-4 Pi Zero 2 W: level-2 memory pass, rerun with the shared-libcrypto memory builds
# (r4-pi02w-shrincs<B|L>-openssl-mem, as on the Pi Zero W). The static-libcrypto memory builds
# of pi02w.plan aborted at process exit (free(): invalid pointer) in all 23 lines. Derived
# from those 23 lines of pi02w.plan, build and label changed.
r4-pi02w-shrincsB-openssl-mem|r4-L2-mem shrincs-B openssl3.4.1; gcc13.3 -O2|slh_dsa_verify|10
r4-pi02w-shrincsB-openssl-mem|r4-L2-mem shrincs-B openssl3.4.1; gcc13.3 -O2|sphincs40_verify|10
